<title>UK: Rabobank sets 250 mln rand two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 250 mln rand two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.125    MATURITY    10.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.165   PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     DUTCH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	TORDOM IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>  NOTES    THERE IS A REOFFER PRICE OF 100.165</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
